WEBVTT

00:10:28.956 --> 00:10:32.716
in accordance with the spirit
and the consistency

00:10:32.756 --> 00:10:34.876
of the Paris Agreement.

00:10:37.036 --> 00:10:38.836
This is what inspires me.

00:10:38.836 --> 00:10:41.756
And I know, of course,
believing is important,

00:10:41.796 --> 00:10:43.356
but at the end of the day,

00:10:43.396 --> 00:10:46.516
we will be judged by how
we are actually delivering

00:10:46.556 --> 00:10:49.716
on the 1/4/20-gigaton challenge.

00:10:50.196 --> 00:10:51.436
The race is on.

00:10:51.756 --> 00:10:52.956
Thanks.

00:10:52.996 --> 00:10:58.476
(Applause)

00:10:58.916 --> 00:11:00.276
Lindsay Levin: Come back.